License: proprietary
 The Tidal Connect binary and device certificate are proprietary property of
 TIDAL and are redistributed here as provided by the upstream project. They
 are not covered by the Expat license above. They are vendored so that
 tdcn-ssl (which handles the SSL certificate handling, run by tdcn itself
 at every startup) can run without a network fetch.

